{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11102210","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11102210","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1110221001:0":{"text":"이 길에서 붉은 모래 거미 지역이랑 가까워질수록 모래가 빨개. 해골도 많고...","source_cn":"这条路上，离赤沙蛛域越近，沙子就越红。沿途还有不少骸骨……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF24DEA27392E8D4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1110221002:0":{"text":"주변 지형의 흔적을 봤을 때... 아르사, 모래 폭풍을 조심해.","source_cn":"从附近地貌的痕迹判断——阿尔萨，小心沙暴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x729724191EFA6BE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110221003:0":{"text":"걱정 마. 내가 제일 잘하는 게 사람들과 함께 모래 폭풍을 피해 다니는 거야!","source_cn":"放心吧，我可是最擅长带着大家找地方躲避沙暴了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD245CFB8CDC45A65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"아르사","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"소렌","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}